              "sourceType": "complete captured readable body"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note0",
          "literal": "Сигнатуры складывают после печати: листы обрезают и вкладывают друг в друга.",
          "literalSHA256": "0cd67ed2309c7135499e35edbff864f38d39524a4c2c9366537d35dc20f6fd27",
          "primaryGround": "L46-47 state printed sheets are trimmed, cut, folded and bound; the signature is cut into leaves, folded, nested and sewn.",
          "locator": "L46-47",
          "sourcePaths": [
            {
              "path": "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/process-v2-books-remaining10-fresh-source-01a14018/author/sources/tepapa-how-books-printed.html",
