              "sha256": "588a7b199acb02568ad2563f8ef0a9e51db582f59036e776d50dd8f370db4d9c",
              "sourceType": "complete captured readable body"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note3",
          "literal": "Обрезка выполняется после двусторонней печати и закрепления краски, до фальцовки листов.",
          "literalSHA256": "030331eced21b65435a13f50bb119df81cc21b8612cd22cec25e7cb9cdd95d9e",
          "primaryGround": "L46 states sheets are set aside while ink cures and only then trimmed/cut/folded/bound.",
